 * @cssstate open
 * @example -canvas-rce
 * <details class="pfx-toggle-details" open>
 *   <summary>What ships in this package?</summary>
 *   Class-based component styles, built from the Instructure tokens, plus a prose layer.
 * </details>
 * @example -automatica11y
 * ```html
 * <details class="pfx-toggle-details" data-a11y-root>
 *   <summary data-a11y-trigger>What ships in this package?</summary>
 *   Class-based component styles and a prose layer.
 * </details>
 * ```
 * @example -docs
 * <details class="pfx-toggle-details -variant-filled">
 *   <summary>Keyboard support</summary>
 *   The native disclosure control supports keyboard interaction.
