 * <label>
 *   Uploading Document: <progress class="pfx-progress -color-brand" value="70">70%</progress>
 * </label>
 * ```
 * ### External label
 * ```html
 * <label for="storage-used">Storage used</label>
 * <meter id="storage-used" class="pfx-progress -color-warning" min="20" value="40" max="60">50%</meter>
 * ```
 * @structure
 * @variant nested-label {
 *   label {
 *     .pfx-progress {
 *       .bar {}
 *       .value {}
 *     }
 *   }
 * }
 * @variant external-label {
